contentText:
Joy &#8212; the lead vocalist of the Mexican pop duo Jesse & Joy &#8212; brought all her sweetness and sensitivity to the Billboard Latin Women in Music 2026 special, where she delivered an emotional speech while accepting the Spirit of Change award from her friend, actress Justina Machado.

